<cve>CVE-2025-53770</cve>
<cvss3_base_score>9.8</cvss3_base_score>
<description>The on-premises SharePoint Server installation is affected by a deserialization of untrusted data flaw. An unauthenticated attacker can execute code and steal the server's ASP.NET machine keys, which keeps access open even after patching.</description>
