<risk_factor>Critical</risk_factor>
<see_also>https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-53770</see_also>
<solution>Apply the July 2025 SharePoint security update (KB5002754 for SharePoint Server 2019). Enable AMSI in Full Mode with Defender Antivirus, then rotate ASP.NET machine keys and restart IIS after patching.</solution>
<synopsis>The on-premises SharePoint Server installation is affected by a deserialization of untrusted data flaw.</synopsis>
</ReportItem>
