Fixed version     : 9.0.99
Default servlet readonly : false</plugin_output>
<plugin_type>remote</plugin_type>
<risk_factor>Critical</risk_factor>
<see_also>https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-24813</see_also>
<solution>Upgrade Apache Tomcat to 9.0.99 or later. Set readonly=true on the default servlet and disable partial PUT support if it is not required.</solution>
<synopsis>The version of Apache Tomcat on the remote host is affected by a path equivalence flaw in partial PUT handling.</synopsis>
</ReportItem>
