<solution>Delete the docs, examples, host-manager, and manager applications from webapps/ and configure custom error pages.</solution>
<synopsis>The default error pages, documentation, and example web applications are installed on the remote Tomcat server.</synopsis>
</ReportItem>
<ReportItem port="22" svc_name="ssh" protocol="tcp" severity="1" pluginID="153953" pluginName="SSH Weak Key Exchange Algorithms Enabled" pluginFamily="Misc.">
<agent>unix</agent>
<cvss3_base_score>3.7</cvss3_base_score>
<description>The remote SSH server allows key exchange algorithms that RFC 9142 marks as SHOULD NOT or MUST NOT, such as diffie-hellman-group1-sha1 and diffie-hellman-group-exchange-sha1.</description>
<fname>153953.nasl</fname>
<plugin_name>SSH Weak Key Exchange Algorithms Enabled</plugin_name>
<plugin_output>diffie-hellman-group1-sha1
diffie-hellman-group14-sha1
diffie-hellman-group-exchange-sha1</plugin_output>
<plugin_type>remote</plugin_type>
<risk_factor>Low</risk_factor>
<solution>Remove the weak algorithms from the server's KexAlgorithms list ('ip ssh dh min size 2048' and 'ip ssh server algorithm kex' on IOS XE).</solution>
<synopsis>The remote SSH server allows key exchange algorithms that RFC 9142 marks as SHOULD NOT or MUST NOT, such as diffie-hellman-group1-sha1 and diffie-hellman-group-exchange-sha1.</synopsis>
</ReportItem>
</ReportHost>
