<cvss3_base_score>7.8</cvss3_base_score>
<description>The version of WinRAR on the remote host is affected by a directory traversal flaw. Extracting a crafted archive can write files outside the target folder, such as into the user's Startup folder, which leads to code execution at next logon.</description>
